# Phone landscape (844 x 390, DPR 3): the title, a Practice round with the tray as a column at the right,
# a hint and a pair by touch, the lesson banner as a side panel, the pause card from the tray and Leave.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Daily challenge
frames 10
save title-landscape
touch =Play
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch =Practice
until 120 Unranked. Restart
frames 10
touch =Start
until 300 digits left
frames 170
save round-landscape
touch =Hint
frames 30
touch =Pause
until 120 Resume
frames 10
save pause-landscape
touch =Leave round
until 120 Daily challenge
frames 10
touch =Play
until 120 Choose a mode
frames 10
touch =Learn
until 120 Pick a lesson
frames 10
touch =4. Across the fold
until 300 digits left
frames 40
save lesson-landscape
touch =Row 1, column 3, digit 7
frames 8
touch =Row 2, column 1, digit 3
frames 40
expect Now 6 and 4 make ten along the row.
